title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Which verdict and why
route: /authorizations/eligibility/R-1042
intro: The verdict is worked out from the patient's row, top question first. Any failed question gives 'Fix before billing'. If all pass, a missing authorization gives 'Authorization first'. Otherwise 'Cleared to bill'.
dir: TD
also: Three of the failures (service not covered, another plan pays first, limit used up) are written into the page but no demo patient reaches them.
---
start s1 "A result opens for a patient"
decision q1 "Coverage active on the service date?"
decision q2 "Service covered by the plan?"
decision q3 "Clinic enrolled and in network?"
decision q4 "Another plan pays first?"
decision q5 "Every day or unit limit still has room?"
decision q6 "Authorization needed but not approved?\n(required, in progress, under review, retro request open)"

group gFix "Fix before billing (red)"
  screen f0 "Verdict 'Fix before billing'"
  process f1 "Coverage lapsed or ended\nHeadline 'Fix before billing: coverage lapsed 10/12.'"
  process f2 "Coverage not found\nHeadline 'We could not find coverage.'"
  process f3 "Clinic not enrolled\nHeadline 'Fix before billing: the clinic cannot bill yet.'"
  process f4 "Service not covered, other plan, limit reached (no demo patient)\nHeadline starts 'Fix before billing:' then names the first failed check"
  process f5 "Reason sentence is the detail of the first failed check"
endgroup

group gAuth "Authorization first (amber)"
  screen a0 "Verdict 'Authorization first'"
  toast a1 "Headline 'Covered, but you need an authorization first.'\n'Everything checks out except the authorization. Billing is safe as soon as Summit approves.'"
endgroup

group gOk "Cleared to bill (green)"
  screen o0 "Verdict 'Cleared to bill'"
  toast o1 "Headline 'Cleared to bill: the clinic will be paid.'\n'Coverage, benefits, authorization and enrollment all check out. The clinic can bill Summit for Residential 3.5 on 10/21/2026.'"
endgroup

goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Next actions"

s1 --> q1
q1 -->|No: lapsed, ended| f1 --> f0
q1 -->|No: not found| f2 --> f0
q1 -->|Yes| q2
q2 -->|No| f4 --> f0
q2 -->|Yes| q3
q3 -->|No| f3 --> f0
q3 -->|Yes| q4
q4 -->|Yes| f4
q4 -->|No| q5
q5 -->|No| f4
q5 -->|Yes| q6
q6 -->|Yes| a0 --> a1 --> g1
q6 -->|No| o0 --> o1 --> g1
f0 --> f5 --> g1
